{"articleNo":"377076","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=377076&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [생활관] 2022-하계방학 입사 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.06.15","hit":"18518","attachments":[{"name":"2022-하계방학 입사 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=377076&attachNo=113455"},{"name":"2022-하계방학 입사 안내.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=377076&attachNo=113456"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; word-break: keep-all;\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(243, 197, 52); background-color: rgb(254, 254, 184);\"><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">FAQ</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기에 거주하던 호실이 달라지나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호실 변동 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">하계방학 호실은 <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">입사 당일 </span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2022.06.25.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)14:00</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 확인 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">코로나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">검사 결과서를 꼭 제출해야하나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자가진단 키트 결과를 제출해도 되나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40.1pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -40.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자가진단 키트 검사결과는 인정되지 않으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40.1pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -40.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;유효기간이 지나지 않은 신속항원음성확인서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">/PCR</span><span style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">음성확인문자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">격리통지서 중 택</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">하여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40.1pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -40.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;원스톱서비스에 제출해야 입사 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -40.1pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. 2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기에 결핵진단서를 제출했는데 하계방학 입사 전에 또 제출해야하나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 41.2pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -41.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">검진일이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2022.01.01.</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이후인 진단서 기제출자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 제출자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">는&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 41.2pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -41.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;하계방학 입사 전 원스톱서비스에 제출할 필요가 없습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">입사약정서도 원스톱으로 제출하나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40.8pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -40.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">하계방학 오름관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동 입사자만 입사약정서를 입사안내문에서 다운받아 사전 작성하여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 40.8pt; padding-top: 0px; text-indent: -40.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;입사 당일 체온 측정 후 오름관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">층 현관에서 현장 제출합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">담당자 전화번호가 어떻게 되나요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선발 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 054-478-7943, 7944</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생활관비 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관비 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7947, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">푸름관비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 7201, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2·3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동 공공요금 예치금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7947</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ☞ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">푸름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아름관 시설</span>